{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c715ef53-1e09-5c58-94ba-6c7ba4134fb5", "source_ordinal": 1826, "reading_ordinal": 2231, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "强人所难", "published_at": "2024-01-19T22:55:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/640202811/answer/3368982832"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然是上报、看管并通知家长了，不然还能怎么办？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多年轻人喜欢自己代入，去指责这样做的班主任、心理咨询师，其实只是自我中心主义的老毛病发作了。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "ta们如果真的替你保密，而你后来还是自杀了，ta们就要把职业生涯、个人前途全部陪葬。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你的父母——也就是未成年的你自杀的实际第一责任人——不但没有任何实际责任，还会因此获得绝对有效的追责立场，去向那个对你效忠而被你抛弃的最后的朋友索取天价的赔偿，并将ta送进道德地狱。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "到时候ta怎么办？", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "理论上，你可以说“只要你替我保密，我绝不自杀陷你于不义”，但是一来你并不是这么说的，你说的是“不准告诉我父母，告诉了我就去死”，你并没有承诺“只要不告诉，我保证不死”；二来，请不要嫌这话难听——你即使保证了“不说一定不死”，你的保证真的足够有效吗？", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果你真的可以做到这样言出必行，单凭这种钢铁般的“言出必行”的作风，你的成绩也罢、人缘也罢、家庭地位也罢，恐怕也很难沦落到如此被动和绝望，不是吗？", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你有多少次答应了补作业没有补？答应了要复习没复习？答应了不迟到还是迟到？答应了不玩游戏还是玩了？", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "换了你站在对方的位置上，你觉得这很能赌吗？", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "赌了，就是ta拿身家性命在给你争取最后的机会，这种牺牲有多大，你真的清楚吗？", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这么说吧，站在公平的第三者立场，如果你的老师为你下了这样的赌注，ta以后别说对你严厉，就是打断你的腿，你都仍然欠人家的恩情。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为ta的配偶如果知道ta这么不负责任，是完全应该跟ta离婚的——ta不止是赌了ta自己的前途，还赌了ta配偶、子女的人生幸福，赌在一个不知道这个赌注有多重的人身上。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "按道理来说，人家下了这样的注，那么你就有义务做到无论受到什么样的委屈、感到多么痛苦、遭受什么样的屈辱，都绝对不能自杀。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但是事实呢？事实是ta替你下了这么大的赌注，其实你还是再受点委屈就可能完全忘记你自杀会对ta造成的灾难。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是的，你年纪小，你想不到的，所以没有办法怪你，怪你也是苛求，这没错。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但正是因为这没错、怪不了你，所以ta有绝对合理的立场和绝对充分的权利，拒绝为你下这种极端危险的赌注。", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你没有立场责怪对方不为你额外承担这个被强加的“保密义务”——ta们其实没得选择，不要强人所难。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 919}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：班主任被学生告知要自杀但被要求保密怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“强人所难”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然是上报、看管并通知家长了，不然还能怎么办？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然是上报、看管并通知家长了，不然还能怎么办？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "aa4eb633-1119-5fea-8c17-d40902505f6c", "source_ordinal": 1825, "reading_ordinal": 2232, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "万金油", "published_at": "2024-01-20T12:05:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/29135157/answer/3369437932"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这和水有紧密的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "黄金作为超新星爆炸的产物，实际上是从外层空间由星尘、陨石这些来源带来，随机掉落在地球表面或参与到地球本身的成形过程后由岩浆对流带到地表，也就是说黄金一开始几乎可以说是“随机均匀分布”的。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但这个随机均匀分布很快就遇到了一个天然的富集机制——那就是地表的降雨循环。大量的降水会从广大的山区向河流里汇集，不断的从广大的坡地区域向一个极小的区域搬运物质。而这个搬运比较巧妙——能被水流溶解的那些（例如碳酸钙）都会在亿万年间被渐渐溶解，到远端合适的环境里去结晶析出或者干脆进入海洋；不能被溶解而又比较轻的那些，会被各种机械摩擦、生物侵蚀、温差裂解破碎，最终被水流带走。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而这其中，那些性质既稳定难溶、比重又大的，自然容易在特定的河段被一些特殊的地理因素保护，避开激烈的水流冲刷而被保留下来。黄金就是这些容易“提前下车”的乘客之一。它们的下车地点往往是一些崇山峻岭的边缘，与大型河流激流区相邻的缓流地带，而且常常与一些较重、较难溶的沙砾相伴，这也是为什么黄金常常是要用“淘”的。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而石油呢，却恰恰是河流带走的其他部分较轻、较易溶的固形物在远端沉积的结果。在这些地区，会形成浅海、滩涂，水中的植物同时获得水和阳光两个关键的要素，生长会特别繁茂。深海区海底离阳光太远，只能有基于浮游生物和热源生物的贫瘠生态。而浅海、淡水滩涂这些地方既然富有植物，自然也就吸引到大量的动物。加上亿万年源源不绝的沙砾覆盖，很容易形成石油矿藏。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这样就比较好玩了——同一条河，是先把黄金放下，再把剩下的物资拿去堆沙滩的。有沙滩就有阳光和水藻、湿地，有水藻、湿地就有大量的动植物遗体，有动植物遗体又有千万年用不尽的沙砾，就会有石油。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "简单来说，“金沙江”和“江汉油田”“东海油气田”其实是同一个母亲所生的同胞兄弟。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而它们注定分离。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 758}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：石油和金有什么地质学方面的关系？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“万金油”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这和水有紧密的关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这和水有紧密的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8f0ff3e0-cfe1-5cc0-8986-41217ded3fa6", "source_ordinal": 1824, "reading_ordinal": 2233, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "龙门教", "published_at": "2024-01-21T00:16:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/636449086/answer/3370138412"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国教育里这类“跳龙门”心态太强烈了，有点可怜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "参加各种竞赛的价值不应该是能不能拿来跳龙门，而应该还原到“借助激烈的竞争环境磨练自己的专长”上。最后认可你的专长价值的是市场上不知名的用户和未来的人类历史，不是什么“名校”和“大手企业”这种龙门。客观上有能力，自己心态健康，不必入这些龙门你也可以活得很精彩。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "满脑子“非入龙门不得幸福”“凭什么ta可以跳过去”“不入龙门皆凡种”这类本质上是文化种族主义的妄念，你跳进“龙门”结果也一样摆脱不了价值观扭曲而导致的结构性焦虑。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那些两个弹夹歼灭半个系的前辈可是跳进龙门里再上的社会新闻。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦龙门学入脑，人就会把人生当成无限跳龙门游戏。这游戏在逻辑上就指向两个必然的坏结果——迟早要么有一个跳不过去而炸锅，要么跳过去后对“龙门福利”大失所望而炸锅。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "敢跳、爱跳、会跳的鲤鱼就是龙。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "龙门只是个游戏名。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 373}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待麻省理工 MIT 录取北师大附属实验中学李同学？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“龙门教”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国教育里这类“跳龙门”心态太强烈了，有点可怜。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国教育里这类“跳龙门”心态太强烈了，有点可怜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b3561d82-ce0d-5881-a062-dd9c7024ba49", "source_ordinal": 1823, "reading_ordinal": 2234, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "跌打酒", "published_at": "2024-01-21T15:50:06+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/639789044/answer/3370716360"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个要看你是否认为“从没有答案到好歹凑出个错误答案”是一种进步。都是零分，但这个好歹写了，不是交白卷，这算不算进步？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "坦率讲，心理学自发明以来固然是产生了巨大的销量，但它总体而言到底创造了多少净福利是非常值得怀疑的。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "宏观的讲，它其实是用另一种焦虑的结构在否定你当前焦虑的结构，其实拿来替换的这个零件也是不灵的，会出另一方面的问题，但是在这替换的周期内，可以给你一种“解决感”罢了。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为人的病根并不是所谓的问题，而是人天生的设计缺陷——对死亡、衰败的恐惧。由着这种恐惧，产生了人生的焦虑和痛苦，为了排解这些痛苦，产生了寻找责任人的需求，由着这需求，产生了“到底凶手是谁”的定罪游戏。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "定在自己身上，就恨自己，恨自己懒惰、愚蠢、懦弱，把自己本该有的富贵、荣光、美好享受弄飞了，要杀了自己报仇。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "定在别人身上，就恨别人，恨别人自私、贪婪、愚蠢，把我本该有的富贵、荣光、美好享受弄飞了，要杀了别人报仇。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "总之富贵、荣光、美好是不能变的，谁妨碍了，谁就该死，人挡杀人、我挡杀我。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "心理学纠结的点就在这里——它不敢、不愿、不能去否定这个面向“富贵、荣光、美好”的基本人生观，因为这就是所谓“现代主义”的根基，心理学本身作为现代主义思想拿来顶替传统超越性信仰的新雇工，不能否定现代主义敕封的另一名同事——个人主义。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "毕竟，平等主义、人本主义、自由主义……等等一系列可以“创造需求”“解放生产力”的新诸神的神位远比“心理学”这种社区灶王爷的地位尊崇，哪是心理学所能挑衅的。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，心理学只能在肯定“不违法的个人追求不受批判”的立场上做一些“改善体验”性质的服务。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你违法，那我是要举报且拒绝服务的。但只要不违法，那么你想要什么，我无权也无立场评判，我的服务就是帮助你做一些拉伸和按摩，让你在追求这些不违法的目标时被拉伤的心理筋膜得到舒缓、肌肉得到放松，然后收取理疗费用。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而这其中，这种类似艾灸、拔罐、刮痧式的“以彼处受控之损伤舒缓此处强迫性之痛”的疗法就顺理成章成了一种主流手段。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“原生家庭”就是这样一种心理拔罐。小玻璃瓶子往背上一扣，拔得毛细血管爆裂，“湿气”就散出来了，免疫力就增强了。", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "注意，这里可没有说“拉伸、按摩没有用”，这当然有用。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这就好像山鸡哥们用的跌打师傅，那是实实在在经验丰富的外伤圣手，不然那么多兄弟怎么可能纵横江湖这么久还生龙活虎？问题是，兄弟们在这里缝好伤口、修好骨折、接上脱臼，下个星期还要接着去扫丧彪的场子，要去争鱼蛋佬的粉档生意。", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "真正让兄弟们“迟早要还”的是“出来混”，不是“缺少跌打医生”，或者跌打医生们缺少发明拔罐疗法。", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，这个发言可以说是对的——对跌打医生们而言，拔罐疗法可以赚钱，当然是一大突破；对铁杆山鸡哥们也是对的，有了拔罐疗法，下次和东星争场子出刀可以更快。", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1151}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "甚至对街坊邻居们来说，拔罐疗法也不能说没有价值——毕竟，除了砍人，别的原因也可能造成需要按摩拉伸来治疗的伤情。", "char_start": 1152, "char_end": 1207}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但是——注意这个但是——你有没有想过，对于山鸡哥们而言，不要出来混、不要当矮骡子，才是真正关键的健康问题？", "char_start": 1208, "char_end": 1261}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "社会真正需要的进步，是重新反思建构在资本主义、物质主义之上的个人主义、纵欲主义的价值观，而不是为这些价值观服务的新技术、新方法。", "char_start": 1262, "char_end": 1326}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "山鸡哥们需要的是离开社团，而不是庆祝社团找到了更好的跌打酒配方。", "char_start": 1327, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你的不幸的根源不是你有“不幸的遭遇”，而是你用了一些用起来更轻松，但会带来诅咒的方式在对付这些遭遇带来的痛苦。", "char_start": 1361, "char_end": 1416}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而你之所以会用这些方法，和个人主义、纵欲主义的流行价值观有深入骨髓的本质关联。", "char_start": 1417, "char_end": 1456}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "“原生家庭”论只是对这些价值观的新包装，你如果笃信它，就会和相信“只要有了足够好的跌打医生，混社团也能出头天”一样。", "char_start": 1457, "char_end": 1515}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "没有哪种跌打医生能好到让你天下无敌，恰恰相反——你越相信这些东西的奇效，反而越危险。", "char_start": 1516, "char_end": 1558}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "当然，对社团而言，跌打医生们找到更好的跌打酒是一种“进步”。", "char_start": 1559, "char_end": 1589}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但对你而言，这却可能是一种“可以使错误的选择撑得更久点”的“进步”。", "char_start": 1590, "char_end": 1624}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你热爱赌马，有个老兄教了你一种相马的技术，真的可以为你多带来几场胜利，这真是“进步”吗？", "char_start": 1625, "char_end": 1669}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何理解心理学教授徐洁分享的「原生家庭概念在当下被放大是社会的进步」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“跌打酒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个要看你是否认为“从没有答案到好歹凑出个错误答案”是一种进步。都是零分，但这个好歹写了，不是交白卷，这算不算进步？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个要看你是否认为“从没有答案到好歹凑出个错误答案”是一种进步。都是零分，但这个好歹写了，不是交白卷，这算不算进步？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "76637a5d-8fd5-5f07-b9e8-951adb1d4e8a", "source_ordinal": 1822, "reading_ordinal": 2235, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "松烟", "published_at": "2024-01-22T12:38:19+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/572587157/answer/3371672428"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是因为松树富含油脂，燃烧过程中会有大量的树脂酸分解，产生的短链分子剧烈挥发，强行带走热量，导致火焰温度降低，进而导致燃烧很难完全。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "简单说就是烧起来浓烟滚滚而且气味刺鼻。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因此我国传统上不是拿来当柴烧，而是用特制的烟窑炼制，采集烟煤合胶制墨。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "老实说这跟“防治病虫害”关系不大。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 140}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：死松树为什么不能做柴烧？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“松烟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是因为松树富含油脂，燃烧过程中会有大量的树脂酸分解，产生的短链分子剧烈挥发，强行带走热量，导致火焰温度降低，进而导致燃烧很难完全。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是因为松树富含油脂，燃烧过程中会有大量的树脂酸分解，产生的短链分子剧烈挥发，强行带走热量，导致火焰温度降低，进而导致燃烧很难完全。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3ce7c0e8-3dc6-5355-bc38-49c4de88bfa3", "source_ordinal": 1821, "reading_ordinal": 2236, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "香槟大厅", "published_at": "2024-01-23T04:24:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/640609855/answer/3372535893"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这种公共场合拍摄，路人没有隐私权，也就是对方可以把你拍入镜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但是你可以开着自己的记录设备，问他们这是为什么而拍摄的素材，如果对方说是为自己的Youtube账号拍摄的，你可以先问ta们是什么账号，然后友善的提示ta们——", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“很遗憾，with all due respect，我不能同意我的形象被用于这个用途。为了避免你们不必要的麻烦，建议你们不要使用这段素材。如果你们觉得这对你们有不公平的损失，可以联系这个号码，我的律师可以处理你们的合理诉求。”", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这样对方知道你不是在开玩笑，而且你并不好对付。这话我既然说的出来，坦率讲，你最好不要认为你有权如何如何就真的可以如何如何，因为我有权对你做的事不少，足够让你掂量掂量。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "还是那句话，礼貌、严谨、专业的威慑，要比狂暴、错乱、张扬的恐吓要好得多。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "当你显露敌意的时候，最好让对方意识到先手已失、危不可卜、无可侥幸，额头微微发热，貌似有一个红点，而妥协的台阶已经铺好，受降大厅里还有冰镇的香槟供应。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "威胁别人的时候没有礼貌，这是社会性发育有缺陷、缺少应对问题的能力的表现。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "没人会接受儿童的威胁——哪怕这个儿童真的很危险，也一样不行。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 490}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价英国街头钢琴家 Brendan Kavanagh 在直播过程中与几名中国游客的纠纷？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“香槟大厅”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这种公共场合拍摄，路人没有隐私权，也就是对方可以把你拍入镜。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这种公共场合拍摄，路人没有隐私权，也就是对方可以把你拍入镜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cd208847-a71f-56c3-80c3-5b1fad498c8d", "source_ordinal": 1820, "reading_ordinal": 2237, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "勉强", "published_at": "2024-01-23T20:34:06+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/628513622/answer/3373525302"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果不喜欢房子现有的结构，可以不买、不租，不要买了、租了回来再盘算自己改结构。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "修改的成本远高于筛选选择的成本，这不仅仅是房子如此，交朋友，谈恋爱、找工作、招人、合伙……几乎一切有战略性的选择都是如此。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "顺势而为的成本总是小于改天换地，你的能量和资源要多用在因势利导上，不要用在移星换斗上。要在“明智选择”阶段上投入足够的侦查、研究资源，这才是值得用好钢的“刀刃”。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果需要改房梁，这房子就对你太勉强了。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对现状的改造，要重视借用免费的自然机制、尽量采用可逆的、非损伤性的、可以改进、移动和复用的方案，而尽量少采用伤筋动骨的、不可逆的、不能复用的方案。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 277}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：请帮忙看下这根梁下的小钢筋可以切掉吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“勉强”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果不喜欢房子现有的结构，可以不买、不租，不要买了、租了回来再盘算自己改结构。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果不喜欢房子现有的结构，可以不买、不租，不要买了、租了回来再盘算自己改结构。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "76036c56-50bc-5e62-b949-2727af7b8226", "source_ordinal": 1819, "reading_ordinal": 2238, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "标王", "published_at": "2024-01-23T21:45:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637549648/answer/3373597645"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "那些宏伟的、战略性的东西不多说了，你有一个非常具体的努力要做，就是提高归纳总结能力和叙述能力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你的表达是非常含混和碎片化的，充斥着含义不确定、结构不严谨的表达。这不光会导致别人很难摸明白你的具体意思，还会带来别人的一种恐惧——不敢跟你接触。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "具体来说，就是类似你来向别人表达一轮诉求，“我要如何如何如何如何”，你表达了很大篇幅，然后问人行不行，结果对方发现这问题很难回答——因为对方没听懂你到底要的是什么、你为什么要这些、愿意给的话要如何判定你真的得到了、得到了自己会得到什么回报、不答应的话会付出什么代价……", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "就像要在一份不认识的文字写成的合同上签字，这谁敢签？", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "更可怕的是，人家没听明白的前提下也不敢随便拒绝，因为也不清楚自己拒绝的到底是什么，万一你是要救命，ta拒绝就是拒绝救你一命，岂不是要结个大怨？", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一下就把人架在半空中，进不得也退不得了。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这种处境太过于危险和痛苦，没人会乐于尝试的。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "注意，这还不涉及到对方是否真的赞同或者反对你的诉求，因为对方根本都没进展到这一步。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只要你能清楚明白的说明自己的诉求，讲清楚自己的“合同”，那么地球这么大，几十亿人，再奇葩的合同都没准有人肯签。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你查一查——德国有个食人魔，登广告找人吃，都有一堆人回信申请——这例子是扎眼了点，但这例子其实对人有很大的安慰——只要你能说得清，你就是个食人魔都有人理，总不至于绝对孤独。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而你现在处在一个“说不清”的状态。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如前所述——这个“情绪强烈但说不清楚”的状态是最糟糕的状态，对你这种孤独绝望的困境有最根本的决定性作用。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "解决了这个清晰表达问题，也许还有一个“上哪里找到更多认可的人”的问题；但不解决这个问题，人甚至没有找到认同者的基础。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以，别的问题先摆一边，建议你多去研究一下“合同撰写”“招标书撰写”这类基本表达技术，多阅读一些这类优秀范本，先学会准确的、严谨的表达自己的诉求，精确的界定何谓达成合同、何谓违约，准确的、定量的描述违约条款和履约福利。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 824}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "看清楚，这里给你把圈子画得极小，没说要你去遍读世界名著、三坟五典、八索九丘，仅仅是“合同撰写”“招标书撰写”这么两个应用文分类而已。", "char_start": 825, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个是你当前的首要问题，而不是“与女性的关系”问题。否则你处在一个合同、标书都写不清的状态，去痛恨别人都不肯接你的标、并将这种普遍的回避理解为“没人看得起我”，这个判定实在有些言之过早。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 985}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "做出对方就是在故意藐视 / 侮辱 / 欺骗 / 霸凌 我这类定罪性质的判断，应该是严谨的排除了一切其它可能才可以去考虑的最后选项。没有经过前面的一系列严谨的排除就提前跳到这些选项上，只会导致你自己不断的陷入与影子和风车不共戴天的决斗，过早的耗尽自己，陷入堂吉诃德式的悲剧。", "char_start": 986, "char_end": 1122}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是你必须做掉的功课，做了这些功课再看是什么情形，情形不好，你还可以先做一番“优化中标条件和报酬条款”的设计优化工作。", "char_start": 1123, "char_end": 1182}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "把这些工作都做到位了，还是没人应标，再考虑“仇恨”不迟。", "char_start": 1183, "char_end": 1211}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0331"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：确信无法与自己、女生、世界和解后，你看我这余生该如何度过，换成你是我，你又会如何度过？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“标王”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“那些宏伟的、战略性的东西不多说了，你有一个非常具体的努力要做，就是提高归纳总结能力和叙述能力。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "那些宏伟的、战略性的东西不多说了，你有一个非常具体的努力要做，就是提高归纳总结能力和叙述能力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
